WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
A young man in a leather apron
steps into a tailor's shop.

2
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:08.060
He steps out in a top hat,
a tailcoat and gloves.

3
00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:13.170
A lawyer has made the announcement: Pip
will be "brought up as a gentleman".

4
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.780
But does a new coat make you a gentleman?

5
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.700
Does money?

6
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.110
Do manners?

7
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.430
Now watch a plain plank of wood.

8
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.310
A brush loads with shiny varnish.

9
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.110
What will the shine do to the grain?

10
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.560
In this mission, you'll decode
a saying from Herbert's father,

11
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.100
about varnish and the grain of wood.

12
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.640
And you'll meet men who
look like gentlemen,

13
00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:38.150
and one who doesn't, and
test each one yourself.

14
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.800
Your mission: decide whether
Pip is a gentleman yet.
